	"description": {
		"ja": [
			"• ガンダムアメイジングレッドウォーリアが最新のMGフォーマットで立体化。",
			"• 劇中同様さまざまなポージングが可能。可動する手首により11話の降臨シーンも再現できる。",
			"• 胸部ミサイルのハッチは背部の突起を押すと連動して展開。",
			"• 肩部バーニアユニットは可動式。",
			"付属のオプションパーツは様々な用途で使用が可能。武器同士の合体、腰部にマウント等使い方は多種多様。"
		],
		"en": [
			"• Gundam Amazing Red Warrior is now three-dimensional in the latest MG format.",
			"• Possible in various poses as in the movie. The movable wrist allows you to recreate the advent scene from episode 11.",
			"• The chest missile hatch expands when you press the protrusion on the back.",
			"• Shoulder vernier unit is movable.",
			"The included optional parts can be used for various purposes. There are many ways to use it, such as combining weapons, mounting it on the waist, etc."
		]
	},
